      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3210",
      "seed": 3210,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 791845275,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779000059194,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "读图重点：PlannerAgent 只负责“规划与委派”；真正的浏览器动作只发生在 BrowserAgent -> BrowserToolkit -> PageSession -> Playwright 这一侧。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "读图重点：PlannerAgent 只负责“规划与委派”；真正的浏览器动作只发生在 BrowserAgent -> BrowserToolkit -> PageSession -> Playwright 这一侧。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bottom_note2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 1195,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 42,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3227",
      "seed": 3227,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 101818773,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779000059194,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "因此当用户问“搜索天气”时，正确链路不是 Planner 直接搜索，而是 Planner 调用 use_browser_agent(task)，再由 BrowserAgent 调用 go_to_url、view_current_page_status、input_text、click_element、extract_content。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "因此当用户问“搜索天气”时，正确链路不是 Planner 直接搜索，而是 Planner 调用 use_browser_agent(task)，再由 BrowserAgent 调用 go_to_url、view_current_page_status、input_text、click_element、extract_content。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
